# (the redaction-guarantee test) — confirmed by reading the file, not assumed. Re-run the
# same command after adding new test fixtures with credential-shaped strings, and append
# any NEW fixture-only fingerprint here; never add a row for a hit outside this repo's own
# tests/ — that would be a real finding, not scanner noise, and belongs in drift.json.
